  "overall_notes": "The paper focuses on NLG meta-evaluation methodology rather than NLG generation itself. The NLG tasks studied are text summarization and dialogue generation, using existing benchmarks. The main contribution is proposing a new meta-evaluation framework with automatic benchmark construction and testing 16 LLMs as evaluators. Extensive human evaluation is conducted for benchmark validation. Metadata extraction was generally accurate but needed normalization and consolidation of redundant information."
